#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Generate Malay (ms) and Indonesian (id) copies of the English CMS data files.

The storefront reads localized content via ``loadLocalizedData``, which falls
back through ``<name>.ms.json`` / ``<name>.id.json`` -> ``<name>.en.json`` ->
``<name>.json``.  This script translates the English source-of-truth files into
the two new locales by substituting translatable strings, while leaving brand
names, product names, URLs, SKUs, prices and store addresses untouched.

Run from the repo root::

    node scripts/translate-data-locales.py   # (Python 3)
    python3 scripts/translate-data-locales.py
"""

